          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "निकामी — nikāmī — \"out of action; useless\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "स्टेशनवरचा जुना पंखा आता निकामी झाला आहे. sṭeśanvarcā junā paṅkhā ātā nikāmī jhālā āhe. The old fan at the station no longer works at all."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "It does not change: निकामी (nikāmī) पंखा, निकामी (nikāmī) गाडी; निकामी (nikāmī) होणे, to stop working for good."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "निकामी (nikāmī) is inherited: CDIAL lists Marathi nikāmī, \"idle, useless\", under Sanskrit niṣkarman, \"inactive\", that is, without work (CDIAL 7475)."
            }
          ]
        },
